<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-Lend Lease lower as profit reassessed.</title>
<headline>RTRS-Lend Lease lower as profit reassessed.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1996-09-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares in property development, funds management, building and civil engineering group Lend Lease Corp Ltd tumbled on Monday as investors reassessed their holdings in the light of Friday's lower than expected full year profit, brokers said.</p>
<p>By 3.15 p.m. (0515 GMT), Lend Lease shares were 69 cents or over three percent lower at A$19.69 on turnover of 325,322 shares.</p>
